Qualcomm XBL (Rom‑Boot) → TZ (Trusted Monitor) → UEFI (pre‑loaded in FirmwareImage.1). The UEFI binary is signed with the OEM key (0xA7C0…). Secure‑Boot status observed in the bootlog: <br/>[SECURE_BOOT] Verification PASSED for image Slot B. <br/>- No user‑visible way to disable Secure Boot without opening the case and manipulating eFuses; the firmware checks the SECURE_BOOT_DISABLE bit in the NVS partition, which is set to 1 (enabled) in retail units.
